  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Business Development and Training Services Program for Investment</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Prog. de Servicios para el Desarrollo Empresarial y Capacitacin para Inversin</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo del Programa es apoyar la rehabilitacin del sector empresarial haitiano, particularmente de unidades productivas pequeas y medianas en sectores o cadenas de valor prioritarias, a travs de la provisin de servicios de desarrollo empresarial que: (i) faciliten su acceso al crdito; o (ii) potencien la rentabilidad y productividad de los planes de expansin o proyectos de inversin que financien con nuevos prstamos.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the Program is to support the rehabilitation of Haitian entrepreneurial sector, particularly small and medium productive units in priority sectors or value chains, through the provision of business development services that: (i) facilitate their access to credit; or (ii) enhance the profitability and productivity of expansion plans or investment projects to be financed with new loans.</narrative>
  </description>
